DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T173000
UID:tribe-10003821@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:Join us for NerTech STEM\, 3rd-6th grade students are invited 
 to a program where kids will learn about engineering through the lens of J
 ewish values andtikkun olamtaught by two of our very own TNT teens! We wil
 l incorporate lessons on engineering and its relationship to Judaism\, alo
 ng with many fun\, educational\, hands-on activities including Lego bridge
 s and Hydraulic Hands. Students will have the opportunity to explore their
  curiosities and learn to innovate and experiment.
