  service. After lunch\, we’ll screen the documentary\, An Unorthodox Edu
 cation.This documentary exposes the tragedy of tens of thousands of Jewish
  children in New York City that are not receiving a basic education. Q+A f
 ollowing with producer Elana Sigall and director Joe Kolman led by Rabbi M
 arc Katz.Registration required.
