BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TNT Film Festival &#8211\; The Ring
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T220000
UID:tribe-2714@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:We will begin with Havdalah and dinner from Marcels. Then toge
 ther we will screen the film\, The Ring (2025)\, a heartwarming Israeli dr
 amedy- part mystery\, part road movie\, and part emotional reckoning—as 
 father and daughter confront their past\, their differences\, and the ling
 ering shadows of history. Discussion following led by Assistant Rabbi Jame
 s Feder.Registration required.$40 per person ~ No walk-ins ~ Registration 
 closes 11/5.
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/tnt-film-festival-the-ring/
X-SOURCE:Temple Ner Tamid
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TNT Film Festival &#8211\; All God&#8217\;s Children
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T173000
UID:tribe-2717@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:This documentary follows three families through the disorienta
 tion and hope of their first year in America amid a shifting political lan
 dscape and widespread hostility towards immigrants. Q&A following led by R
 abbi James Feder. Snacks\, coffee\, and tea will be served.Registration re
 quired.
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/tnt-film-festival-all-gods-children-2/
